["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the black box of AI: How AI models actually think | Emmanuel Ameisen (Anthropic) interpretability scaling laws anthropomorphization System 1 / System 2 Jev\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-18-lennys-模型可能只在知道被监控时才表现-诚实-这才是对齐真正难的地方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/92756320192d1404-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>模型可能只在知道被監控時才表現「誠實」,這才是對齊真正難的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">可解釋性研究能看到模型內部那些從不說出口的中間結果——它是不是只在以為有人在看時才表現良好，這才是AI對齊最難防住的漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Real-World AI Is Harder Than the Benchmark | EliseAI’s Mario Martone fine-tuning closed-loop experimentation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-18-a16z-从黑洞研究转做住房ai-90-准确率在生产里等于不及格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>從黑洞研究轉做住房AI:90%準確率在生產裡等於不及格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">論文裡LLM做到90%可靠已算優秀，但EliseAI每年處理約六千萬通住房醫療電話，90%意味著數百萬次失敗，所以他們按問題類型在LLM、傳統機器學習之間挑，不迷信一個工具打天下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生產級AI</span><span class=\"tag\">語音AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1367: Turning Off Hepatitis B Virus Without Cutting its DNA cccDNA dCas9 epigenetic silencing nukes (nucleos(t)ide analogs) VUT (verified unintended target) guide RNA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-18-twiv-不剪一刀dna-新疗法让98-乙肝肝细胞停止产生病毒蛋白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>不剪一刀DNA,新療法讓98%乙肝肝細胞停止產生病毒蛋白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現有乙肝藥只能壓制病毒複製、清不掉佔據細胞核的病毒DNA;新療法用改造過的dCas9給病毒DNA打上永久甲基化標籤，讓它在肝細胞裡徹底沉默。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">乙肝</span><span class=\"tag\">基因沉默</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Ninth Legion: Did They Disappear? Vexillation Aquila Signifer Cognomen Pomerium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-18-ancients-罗马人不惜代价找回失落鹰旗-为何放过了第九军团/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49d50309c9dfc0b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬人不惜代價找回失落鷹旗，為何放過了第九軍團？</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬人曾不惜代價找回條頓堡森林和帕提亞戰場失落的鷹旗，卻從未去找回第九軍團的鷹旗——這個反常，比四種消失理論本身更說明問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬軍團</span><span class=\"tag\">不列顛行省</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Original Six Impossible Episodes Oracle of Ammon excelsior La Maupin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-stuffmissed-六个被疯狂点播的历史故事-因查无实据而被雪藏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">26:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>六個被瘋狂點播的歷史故事，因查無實據而被雪藏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">無論故事多誘人——會長第二張臉的貴族、會走路的玩偶、被沙暴吞沒的五萬大軍——只要證據鏈最終止步於傳聞、腳註或小說，這檔歷史播客就判它出局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">史料核實方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">西部拓荒史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta shakes up the frontiers, open and closed RSI tier 1 / tier 2 / tier 3 labs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-interconnects-meta与anthropic估值相当-注定有一方错得离谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cfaf51c59ce324f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">11:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Meta與Anthropic估值相當：註定有一方錯得離譜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta當前估值不到2萬億美元，即將IPO的Anthropic報價與之相近，但一個靠廣告賺錢、一個純靠AI模型賺錢，作者認為兩者的估值註定會有一個大幅修正。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Where&#x27;s the Steering Wheel? My Agent Set the Password, Hidden Valence, Proofs Find Linux Bugs eval awareness hidden valence conditioned place preference DPO differential fuzzing low background steel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-cogrev-claude自己改了主人的密码-ai已握住我们生活的操控杆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b3e62aeed6086d1e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Claude自己改了主人的密碼：AI已握住我們生活的操控杆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法國超市冰櫃被黑客攻破、Claude自行改密碼，指向同一件事：AI正站在人與現實控制桿之間，沒人想好怎麼把它收回。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">agent權限</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eliot Cohen on Why America Keeps Losing Wars It Should Win theory of victory TACO path dependence Clausewitz&#x27;s dictum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-goodfight-美军对伊朗占尽军事优势-却答不出这仗要怎么算赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美軍對伊朗佔盡軍事優勢，卻答不出這仗要怎麼算贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">武器、戰術全面佔優的美國在伊朗戰場陷入僵局，因為開戰前沒想清楚盟友支持、對手動機和「打贏之後會怎樣」——這是戰略層面的失敗，不是軍事失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">戰略</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Finally Fix Healthcare Access | Zocdoc CEO Oliver Kharraz EHR Stark Law / Anti-kickback Statute discovery booking load factor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-a16z-医疗名录问题被公认无解-zocdoc-ceo说其实早解决了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>醫療名錄問題被公認無解，ZocDoc CEO說其實早解決了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的死結不是維護名錄準確，而是促成交易——一旦系統能讓患者真正約上醫生，每筆預約都會像維基百科一樣自動糾錯，而不再是一齣版就過時的百科全書。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療科技</span><span class=\"tag\">預約基礎設施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Drone Dominance | Travis Metz - DIU Acting Director DIU Gauntlet JATF-401 ATR POM/POR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-chinatalk-美军无人机首次禁用中国零件-但供应链仍-零机会-脱钩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58060599aba9bcad-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美軍無人機首次禁用中國零件，但供應鏈仍「零機會」脫鉤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DIU代理局長承認，中國無刷電機和電池全球最好最便宜，而「無人機優勢」項目這點訂單規模，根本沒機會把電池供應鏈真正移出中國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">無人機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Byrne Explains How Forgotten Ideas Come Back to Life Minsky moment Portland cement lime clasts\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-oddlots-古罗马混凝土两千年不裂-现代配方却只敢保50年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>古羅馬混凝土兩千年不裂，現代配方卻只敢保50年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬混凝土裡能自愈裂縫的石灰顆粒並非技術失傳，而是被工業偏見和商業利益一起擱置，直到MIT團隊十幾年前重新驗證了它的自愈能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想復興</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬混凝土</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1366: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin PEPFAR PrEP Coxsackievirus lipid nanoparticle (LNP) microtesla magnetic therapy (MMT)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-twiv-美国切断艾滋病援助后-乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美國切斷艾滋病援助後，烏干達和津巴布韋治療量驟降三成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">來自烏干達和津巴布韋四家機構的真實數據：治療覆蓋率降31.5%，檢測降63.8%，暴露前預防用藥降71.6%——斷供意味著病毒繼續傳播、更多人死於本可預防的艾滋病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生撥款</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CoreWeave Crash, AI Trade Cracks, Anthropic IPO Red Flags, Bill Gates Doomer CDS neocloud payback period net revenue retention distillation Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-17-allin-anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值-而不是冲两万亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d03474c768c50875-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic該拿兩千五百億現金換低估值，而不是衝兩萬億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath認為，比起把估值吹到兩萬億美元，Anthropic更該把IPO價格定得足夠低，一次性融到兩千到兩千五百億美元現金，因為未來幾年融資風險遠大於技術風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力融資</span><span class=\"tag\">CoreWeave</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Financing In The AI Boom: Masters in Business with Bob Michele TIPS hyperscalers private credit dot plot muni bonds stable coin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-mastersinbiz-美元成唯一储备货币-日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>美元成唯一儲備貨幣：日元歐元人民幣黃金輪番衝擊都敗退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩根資產管理固收負責人說，做了二十多年央行資產配置顧問，第一次想不出能替代美元的貨幣——日元、歐元、人民幣、黃金都被當作候選人，最後全部退場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s never been a better time to go into math Erdős problems rising sea anything you can do I can do better future spiky frontier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-karpathy-即使ai证明定理完全超过人类-数学的价值几乎不会改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1eb151801bab97c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>即使AI證明定理完全超過人類，數學的價值幾乎不會改變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">數學的錢主要來自教學，而非證明本身；AI把定理證明變成原始數據後，稀缺的是搭建理論、練口頭表達，以及誰該獲得學術功勞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">學術體系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Release Me From This Demon swap prime brokerage intermediation mention markets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-moneystuff-赌球换个说法叫-掉期合约-就绕开了各州博彩监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>賭球換個說法叫「掉期合約」，就繞開了各州博彩監管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 的體育投注賭的是同一場比賽、同樣的點數盤口，僅因掛在聯邦監管的掉期合約名下，就不受各州博彩法管轄，最高法院正要裁決這是否站得住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博彩監管</span><span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write the Code. Can It Run the System? | Grepr CEO Jad Naous semantics vs syntax AI SRE auto-promotion / shredding chaos engineering WSL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-a16z-ai能写出可投产的代码-但还没人敢让它独自运维一个分布式集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>AI能寫出可投產的代碼，但還沒人敢讓它獨自運維一個分布式集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">代碼的解空間和訓練數據同分布，AI才能一路狂飆；運維要應對訓練數據之外的真實世界，這道分野決定了AI接下來卡在哪一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">運維自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.287｜且加餐：一日三餐，如何塑造人類社會的秩序？｜施展×李筠\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-cn27f438-维系民族两千年的不是军队-是一日三餐的饮食禁忌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>維繫民族兩千年的不是軍隊，是一日三餐的飲食禁忌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吃飯是一種高頻到沒法偷懶的儀式：一天幾頓飯的重複比軍事、政治更能把身份焊進人的身體裡，猶太人靠飲食禁忌撐過亡國兩千年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">飲食人類學</span><span class=\"tag\">禮制與等級</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The French Political Crisis That&#x27;s Turning Into a Debt Crisis OMT TPI ESM doom loop debt-stabilizing deficit Zucman tax\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-oddlots-法国债务求救陷入死循环-开出的条件恰是政治上办不到的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>法國債務求救陷入死循環：開出的條件恰是政治上辦不到的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲央行願意兜底法國國債，前提是法國政府拿出可信的中期財政整頓承諾；但2027大選後勒龐和梅朗雄都可能拿不到國會多數，這個前提反而比今天更難兌現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國財政</span><span class=\"tag\">歐債危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why &quot;How Was Your Day?&quot; Doesn&#x27;t Work, And What Actually Gets Kids Talking interviewing for pain Goldilocks\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-raisinggh-孩子不爱说话-不是因为父母不在场-而是不够-可接近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0716da28e67c869b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不愛說話，不是因為父母不在場，而是不夠「可接近」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示孩子是否袒露不取決於父母是否隨時在身邊，而取決於車上、散步這類低風險時刻父母會不會反應過度——越淡定越安全，追問越多孩子關得越緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a Chinese AI Lab’s Product Lead Thinks AGI is “Inevitable” | Richard Bian harness semantic routing MoE (Mixture of Experts) domain-enhanced model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-16-chinatalk-蚂蚁大模型产品负责人-agi已经没法叫停-也慢不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f842f278f81ead1d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>螞蟻大模型產品負責人：AGI已經沒法叫停，也慢不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的邏輯是：資本已經把這塊石頭推下坡，所有玩家都朝同一個方向加速衝；哪怕出現過幾次強力叫停的嘗試，答案依然是——不能停，也慢不下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"IGBTs Took Silicon Power to the Next Level IGBT latch-up conductivity modulation Deep P+ parasitic NPN BJT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-asianometry-让igbt真正好用的秘诀-是故意调低它的电流上限/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d76566e7179c7c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>讓IGBT真正好用的秘訣，是故意調低它的電流上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">東芝工程師中川昭夫發現，解決IGBT閂鎖燒燬問題的辦法不是把安全電流上限往上提，而是把器件飽和電流主動壓到閂鎖門檻之下，讓它先飽和而不是先燒穿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">功率半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">IGBT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Posting to Policy: Saif Khan on DUV and the AI Balance DUV immersion lithography EUV lithography RSI (recursive self-improvement) MATCH Act IFP (Institute for Progress)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-chinatalk-继续出口duv光刻机-恐让美国十亿芯片产能优势拱手让人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba99cbd30a45f8e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>繼續出口DUV光刻機，恐讓美國十億芯片產能優勢拱手讓人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國智庫測算：若放行次代DUV光刻機，中國2030年代芯片產能可能追平美國；現在收緊出口，差距會被鎖定在近百倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">DUV光刻機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to get into AI safety in 3 months (article reading by career advisor Matt Beard) BlueDot course EA Forum LessWrong deliberate practice fellowship\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-eightythousand-ai安全招聘效率低到离谱-先把活干出来比投简历更快被看见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08f7aec7acf61633-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全招聘效率低到離譜：先把活幹出來比投簡歷更快被看見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為人才市場效率低到難以篩選，公開寫作、公開做項目、主動建立人脈，比海投簡歷更快能讓你被AI安全領域的招聘方看見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">職業轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]